  "rules": {
    "objective": "The declarer's team must take at least 48 of the 94 card points in tricks (more than half) to win the game.",
    "gameplay": "Bid 3/2/1/Solo (talon cards taken). Call Trump XX = secret partner. Exchange from talon, discard. Follow suit, must trump if void. 9 tricks. Bonuses: Trull (all 3 honours), Pagát ultimo (win last with I), Volát (all tricks).",
